diagram.description:
The activity in this line grammar, one statement per line, up to 40,000 characters, 2,000 lines and 400 characters per line (comments included): start | stop | end | :Action text; | if (condition) then (label) ... elseif (condition) then (label) ... else (label) ... endif | while (condition) is (label) ... endwhile (label) | fork ... fork again ... end fork | note: text | # comment. Labels are optional; conditions and labels must not contain ( or ). Example: "start
:Receive order;
if (in stock?) then (yes)
:Ship it;
else (no)
:Refund;
endif
stop".
